==Macedonian==

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/ˈvrat͡ʃ/|lang=mk}}

===Noun===
'''врач''' (vrač) {{m}}

# [[witch doctor]], [[medicine man]], [[healer]]

==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-врач.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
'''врач''' (vrač) {{m}}

# [[physician]], [[doctor]]

====Usage notes====
A female medical doctor is referred to as '''врач''', or [[женщина]]-врач, or, colloquially only, [[врачиха]].

